      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid cooling at approximately 10^5–10^6 K/s yields an amorphous Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20 structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Phosphorus acts as a glass-forming constituent when present in a sufficient amount.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High mixing or configurational entropy enhances glass-forming ability in the cited phosphorus-containing alloy.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A sufficiently high cooling rate suppresses crystalline phase formation, whereas slower cooling produces more crystalline phases.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid quenching limits atomic diffusion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limited atomic diffusion inhibits crystal nucleation and growth.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid quenching suppresses medium- and long-range atomic ordering.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stabilization of the amorphous structure by rapid quenching increases mixing entropy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed quench-induced stabilization delays crystallization during subsequent heating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rapidly quenched alloy will be fully amorphous as assessed by diffraction and microscopy.",
